			<h1>
				Features and History
			</h1>
			<h2>
				0.5.2 (Changes)
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
				crash with some wave-files fixed
				</li>
				<li>
				seek problems with wave-files fixed
				</li>
				<li>
				wildcard search mismatches corrected
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>
				0.5.3 (Changes)
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
				crash with writing ogg-comments fixed
				</li><li>
				crash with searching much ogg-files fixed
				</li><li>
				song length in search-table included
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>
				0.5.2 (Changes)
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
				Crash on playing some wave-files fixed
				</li><li>
				seek problem on wave-files fixed
				</li><li>
				mismatches on wildcardsearch fixed
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>
				0.5.1 (Changes)
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
				Crash on playing mono sound files fixed (see compiler optimization)
				</li><li>
				a wildcard search was implemented
				</li><li>
				change compiler optimization from size to speed
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>
				0.5.0 (Changes)
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
				crash fixed when starting under some Win2000/XP installations (see automatic
				language detect)
				</li><li>
				some bugs with colout-shemes in Win ME/2000 fixes
				</li><li>
				fixed bug in device dialog
				</li><li>
				crash on char-exteed in search-editbox fixed
				</li><li>
				workaround for Win2000 DirectSound-bug
				</li><li>
				automatic language-detect was remove, because of the incombatibilities between
				different Windows-Versions
				</li><li>
				support for OGG/Vorbis and wave files
				</li><li>
				enhanced scan dialog
				</li><li>
				real-time Time-Stretch-algorithems (some called Mastertempo or Key-Adjust)
				</li><li>
				included comm-functions for a remote-control which is in development
				</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>
				Alpha 4 (Changes)
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
				the complete sourcecode was rewitten (results smaller files, the programm and
				database use now much lower resources)
				</li><li>
				new Playlistedesign and handling (Winamp(TM) like)
				</li><li>
				Mixer/Crossfader as standalone Dialogbox
				</li><li>
				Fadertime and mixstart-time are configurable
				</li><li>
				bug on actualize ID3-Tag fixed
				</li><li>
				bug in Device options (per Player fixed)
				</li><li>
				Sound-bug with moving/resizing windows fixed
				</li><li>
				Help-files include
				</li><li>
				support for french (experimental)
				</li><li>
				and a lot of minor changes
				</li>
			</ul>
				
			<h2>
				Alpha 3 (changes)
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
				new design
				</li><li>
				configurable and savable view
				</li><li>
				hotkeys
				</li><li>
				Drag'n Drop into player
				</li><li>
				as much sound-devices as you like useable
				</li><li>
				growable player as much as you like useable
				</li><li>
				bug on crossfader-refresh fixed
				</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>
				Alpha 2 (Changes)
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
				new Modes at Sounddevice-selection
				</li><li>
				Seek and Cue at exactly fractal
				</li><li>
				Scan-Dialog optimized
				</li><li>
				integrated Online-Help
				</li><li>
				sorted printing of songlists
				</li><li>
				Internationalization (English, German.. more to come)
				</li><li>
				beautifited GUI
				</li><li>
				optimised autocue-function
				</li><li>
				downgrading to DirectX 3 (for NT 4.0 with SP 3)
				</li><li>
				some Exeptions on seeking fixed
				</li><li>
				Division by Zero on loading "dead mp3's" fixed
				</li><li>
				solve unrepruducable problems with threading
				</li><li>
				workaround for problems with some. WDM-Drivers
				</li><li>
				and some minor changes...
				</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>
				Alpha 1
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
				realtime-mixing of two mp3-Files
				</li><li>
				seperatly changing of the playback-rate
				</li><li>
				integrated Mixer
				</li><li>
				prelisten function for headphones (needs second soundcard
				</li><li>
				autoplay
				</li><li>
				saving Cue-Point for every song (Autocue)
				</li><li>
				Playlist-support and import from Winamp-Playlists
				</li><li>
				ID3v1 Tag-editor
				</li><li>
				harddisk-scan for mp3-Dateien extraction of their ID3-Tags
				</li><li>
				integrated Database (Paradox)
				</li><li>
				comfortably search-function for Artist, titel , Genre, und Year
				</li><li>
				load blocked on songs which are currently playing
				</li><li>
				assignable cross-fader
				</li>
			</ul>
			<div id="language_select">
				<a href="index.html.en">english</a> | <a href="index.html.de">deutsch</a>
			</div>	
		</div>
	</body>		
</html>
